# blend_modes.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with Impeller,
# against fl-engine's frame through emblema, both at DPR 2.
# Percent of pixels allowed to differ in any channel, and by more than 32.
#
# The fifteen advanced blend modes, each on a solid circle, a gradient's
# rounded rectangle and a layer of two shapes, over a gradient with a
# translucent band. emblema blends them in the shader, against a copy of
# what is under each draw. Most pixels differ by a level or two: the
# gradients' dither and their interpolation, as in gradients.tolerance. What
# differs by more is antialiased edges, and Impeller's own seams across the
# circles. Measured 2026-11-22: lavapipe 24.962% differ, 0.017% by more than
# 32; radv 26.983%, 0.017%.
differ 35
differ_over_32 0.1
